  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Upgrade runners to `macos-14` by @charliermarsh in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1443\r\n* Bump bundled Ruff version to 0.9.6 by @catwell in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1457\r\n* Set Rust toolchain in `rust-toolchain.toml` by @charliermarsh in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1460\r\n* Update bundled uv version to v0.6.3 by @github-actions in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1461\r\n* Upgrade to `actions/upload-artifact@v4` by @charliermarsh in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1463\r\n* Build against Rust 1.84 by @charliermarsh in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1464\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @catwell made their first contribution in https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/pull/1458\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/astral-sh/rye/compare/0.43.0...0.44.0",
